OL,3,GNEWSAMorel reflects on ferry decision's
OL,4,Apersonal impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man at the centre of criticism over
OL,7,Fthe decision to appoint DFDS to run
OL,8,FJersey's sea links said at times his
OL,9,Frole felt like being inside a washing
OL,10,Fmachine.
OL,12,FDeputy Kirsten Morel, then minister for
OL,13,Fsustainable economic development, faced
OL,14,Fwhat he has described as "tough" media
OL,15,Fscrutiny and "awful" social media
OL,16,Fcomments after DFDS was chosen over
OL,17,FBrittany Ferries after a lengthy and
OL,18,Fcontroversial tender process in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
