OL,3,GNEWSAMorel reflects on ferry decision's
OL,4,Apersonal impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe process started as a joint
OL,7,FJersey-Guernsey tender but ended with
OL,8,Feach island choosing a different
OL,9,Foperator.
OL,11,FMorel said the last year of the
OL,12,Fprevious political term was the only
OL,13,Fone of the eight he has served as a
OL,14,Fpolitician he had not enjoyed.
